      402   DEFINE FRAME Dialog-Frame
      403        b-exit AT ROW 1 COL 1
      404        b-help AT ROW 1 COL 11
      405        b-slt-vat AT ROW 2.04 COL 1
      406        b-slt-vat-cons AT ROW 9.5 COL 1
      407        b-slt-vat-cons-grp AT ROW 16.5 COL 1
