     1786   MAIN-BLOCK:
     1787   DO ON ERROR   UNDO MAIN-BLOCK, LEAVE MAIN-BLOCK
     1788      ON END-KEY UNDO MAIN-BLOCK, LEAVE MAIN-BLOCK:
     1789     RUN enable_UI.
     1790     WAIT-FOR GO OF FRAME Dialog-Frame.
     1791   END.
     1792   RUN disable_UI.
     1793   PROCEDURE disable_UI :
     1794     HIDE FRAME Dialog-Frame.
     1795   END PROCEDURE.
     1796   PROCEDURE enable_UI :
     1797     ENABLE b-exit b-help b-slt-vat b-slt-vat-cons b-slt-vat-cons-grp
     1798         WITH FRAME Dialog-Frame.
     1799     VIEW FRAME Dialog-Frame.
     1800     OPEN QUERY b-slt-vat FOR EACH d-slt-vat.    OPEN QUERY b-slt-vat-cons FOR EACH d-slt-vat-cons.    OPEN QUERY b-slt-vat-cons-grp FOR EACH d-slt-vat-cons-grp.
     1801   END PROCEDURE.
